Get errors and warnings for the project or a specific file.

This tool attempts to refresh diagnostics before returning.

If refreshing diagnostics fails (for example, if the language server does not support pull-based diagnostics), it will return any diagnostics already present. Note that, in this case, the results may be out-of-date, and may or may not reflect the most recent edits. If this happens, do not attempt to re-run this tool in the hope that refreshing will later succeed -- failures are typically persistent, ask the maintainer to check instead.

Don't remove code you've generated just because you can't fix an error. The maintainer can help you fix it.
